  "name": "i18n pre-check - MCP server",
  "description": "Shared read-only MCP server for the i18n skills: Lokalise (projects, EN source, translations, glossary) and GitHub (tree, files, PR diff). Jira, Confluence, OneDrive and Figma go through each user's own connectors. Bearer auth.",
  "active": false,
  "activeVersionId": null,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-05T08:56:01.143Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-05T20:28:43.116Z",
