  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "path": "i18n-precheck",
        "instructions": "Shared data layer for the team's i18n skills. Reads only Lokalise (projects, English source, translations, shared glossary) and GitHub (repo tree, files, PR diff) with read-only credentials, and never writes to them. The one write is create_workbook_upload_link: a create-only upload of a new report into SHARED COMPANY FOLDER I18N/AI AUDITS (rename on conflict, never overwrites). Everything else personal goes through the user's own connectors: Confluence product pages and Jira bugs/Tasks through their Atlassian connector, earlier workbooks through their Microsoft 365 access, Figma through their Figma connector. Typical run: get_repo_tree / get_pr_diff -> get_repo_files (batches of 150) -> list_lokalise_projects + get_en_source (compare keys_seen with keys_total) -> get_shared_glossary -> get_translation_lengths -> workbook -> create_workbook_upload_link -> PUT the file."
      },
